{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48397","headline":"碾驴鞍判 · 罗绍威","name":"碾驴鞍判","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邺城大道甚宽，何故驾车碾鞍。\n领鞴驴汉子科决，待驾车汉子喜欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗绍威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}